{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一块白色大字，两行粗体文字字号最大、亮度最高且位置最靠前；随后中部和下部两块同样醒目的大字也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他原本想藏住喜欢，却在对方持续亲近时不知不觉流露出在乎，已经被对方看出来。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定。第一块主要传达喜欢被看出来，具体的失落、忐忑和害怕被嫌弃没有在第一眼形成明确印象。\",\n  \"missed\": \"被看出来之后，他心里空落落的，连相处方式都拿不准；他担心自己太黏会被嫌弃，原本熟悉的亲近也因此产生了距离感。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块同样显眼的大字争夺主视线，视觉入口之后缺少明确的主次。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：第一块交代喜欢被看出，第二块交代空落和不知所措，第三块交代害怕被嫌弃及亲近感变远，需要拼接才能理解完整的处境与感受。\",\n    \"每块大字本身都包含多个意思，快速扫视难以同时拿到完整信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd6e3b87-ea08-4ee6-8bbc-a3f07b3688eb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030246239615Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:03:16.040789+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7eb30b7ef14e40e5d8b708f2ada83c15dbeb03d11cc5a559de8777b3460d6989", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3